/-!
# Section 5.4-5.6: the required exercises

The required problems of Sections 5.4-5.6 of Shen-Uspensky-Vereshchagin: Problems 135 and 140
of Sections 5.4-5.5, and Problems 143, 144, 145, 146 and 147 of Section 5.6.

The remaining required problems (158, 161, 162, 165, 169, 170, 174, 176, 185, 187) belong to
